s=\"calibre2\"><img src=\"index-26_1.png\" class=\"calibre1\"/></p>\r\n<p class=\"calibre2\">Kate is ecstatic. </p>\r\n<p class=\"calibre2\">“But what was he doing at Clayton’s?” \r\ne. </p>\r\n<p class=\"calibre2\"/>\r\n<p class=\"calibre2\"><img src=\"index-38_1.png\" class=\"calibre1\"/></p>\r\n<p class=\"calibre2\"> <i class=\"calibre3\">Kiss me damn it! </i>  I implore him, but I can’t move.  I’m\r\n.” </p>\r\n<p class=\"calibre2\"/>\r\n<p class=\"calibre2\"><img src=\"index-41_1.png\" class=\"calibre1\"/></p>\r\n<p class=\"calibre2\">Do I need a visual reminder of the beautiful Christian  <i class=\"calibre3\">I-don\r\n"}
{"step_index":3074,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-19T02:59:14Z","input_tokens":2952,"cache_read_tokens":168637,"output_tokens":326,"tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"import zipfile\nimport re\n\nepub_path = r\"D:\\JV\\novel yoga\\Fifty_Shades_of_Grey_-_E_L_James.epub\"\n\nwith zipfile.ZipFile(epub_path, 'r') as z:\n    all_imgs = []\n    for hf in sorted(z.namelist()):\n        if hf.lower().endswith(('.html', '.xhtml')):\n            raw = z.read(hf).decode('utf-8', errors='ignore')\n            imgs = re.findall(r'<img\\s+src=\"([^\"]+)\"', raw, re.I)\n            if imgs:\n                all_imgs.extend([(hf, img) for img in imgs])\n\nprint(f\"Total gambar / pemisah grafis di buku: {len(all_imgs)}\")\n# Gambar index-7_1.png adalah Bab 1, mari kita hitung berapa banyak header dekoratif\nchapter_imgs = [img for hf, img in all_imgs if img.endswith('.png') and img != 'index-1_1.jpg']\nprint(f\"Total pemisah bab grafis: {len(chapter_imgs)}\")\nfor hf, img in all_imgs[:35]:\n    print(f\"  {hf} -> {img}\")\n","Path":"D:/JV/novel yoga/count_all_img_chapters.py"}}]}
